  "description": "When I started out, I used to guard my \"IP\" with my life. I thought \"these are my secrets, I suffered so much to learn them - I dont want anyone to know\"\n\nI literally used to lie at masterminds about how much money we made (under-reported) so no one would ask me what I was doing. \n\nThen I could just take notes on everyone else. \n\nWhat a mistake. So silly.\n\nOne of the coolest things in my life is seeing the stuff I write and make content about being used in new ways to make money everyday by #Mozination. \n\nMany started from scratch using YT content + my book and create wildly profitable businesses. \n\nEveryday we get about 10 businesses doing over $3,000,000 per year who apply to become portfolio companies.\n\nThe innovation of the community (and our portfolio CEOs) teaches me more than I ever learned on my own. \n\nIt's like getting 1000 lifetimes of innovation all at once on your favorite subject - makin money. \n\nWe're all here because other humans figured stuff our and passed it on. We're all gonna die. And if your knowledge dies with you, it's a waste of a life. \n\nEducation is the greatest legacy of all.",
